{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28243","headline":"赠咸阳李少府 · 李远","name":"赠咸阳李少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美貌雄才已少齐，宝书仙简两看题。\n金刀片片裁新锦，玉步重重上旧梯。\n鹏到碧天排雾去，凤游琼树拣枝栖。\n蓬瀛宴罢试回首，一望尘中路正迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}